## Integration acceptance

- Verify pause, mute and stop independently on a player that supports them, and absence of unsupported actions on a restricted player.
- Check keyboard volume/seek bounds and output/source names at 320px and enlarged text.
- Confirm navigation, theme changes and example loading produce no media commands.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

